OL,3,ABoard of Peace says Israel's aid
OL,4,Aresponse after Gaza floods
OL,5,A'insufficent'
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump's Board of
OL,8,FPeace has called on Israel to
OL,9,Fimmediately allow all necessary
OL,10,Fhumanitarian supplies into Gaza after
OL,11,Frain flooded tens of thousands of
OL,12,Ftents.
OL,14,FThe US-backed body, established to
OL,15,Foversee the implementation of Trump's
OL,16,FGaza peace plan, acknowledged the steps
OL,17,Fnow being considered by Israel, but
OL,18,Fsaid "the response remains
OL,19,Finsufficient".
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
