OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABoard of Peace says Israel's aid
OL,4,Aresponse after Gaza floods
OL,5,A'insufficent'
OL,6,
OL,7,FIsrael's military agency in charge of
OL,8,Fco-ordinating aid into Gaza said it had
OL,9,Fallowed in tens of thousands of tents
OL,10,Fand trucks with winter supplies, but
OL,11,Fadded reconstruction "can only begin
OL,12,Fafter Hamas fully disarms".
OL,14,FOn Sunday, three children and a woman
OL,15,Fwere killed when a sand embankment
OL,16,Fcollapsed onto tents in the central
OL,17,FStrip.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
